"<h2>Adding a New Server</h2>\n<ol>\n<li>Navigate to <strong>Servers -> Add Server</strong>.</li>\n<li>Select <strong>Remote VPS (SSH)</strong>.</li>\n<li>Provide connection credentials:\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Host IP / Domain</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Port:</strong> Default <code>22</code></li>\n<li><strong>User:</strong> Recommended <code>root</code></li>\n<li><strong>Authentication Method:</strong> SSH Key or Password.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>Click <strong>Connect &#x26; Test</strong>.</li>\n</ol>\n<h2>Server Bootstrap</h2>\n<p>Once connected, click <strong>Bootstrap Server</strong>. SaaSBase will preview the actions it plans to execute:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Install Docker CE (if not installed).</li>\n<li>Create the shared internal Docker network (<code>saasbase-network</code>).</li>\n<li>Deploy the <strong>Traefik v3</strong> reverse proxy container.</li>\n<li>Configure firewall rules and prepare storage paths.</li>\n</ul>"